  "2026-07-26T07:42:59.010Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all 2,058 tracker items across every status for the exact workspace-history settings drift message, Sentry PM-CLI-2M, audited mutation path, and reconciliation. Closed pm-klo8 owns the audit stream and open pm-9yfo owns completeness enumeration, but neither owns expected-error classification and recovery for intentional fail-closed drift detection. Live Sentry evidence: release 2026.7.26 produced six handled events in one minute; sanitized stack metadata contains no actionable command context."
  "2026-07-26T07:47:43.709Z","harness:codex","Evidence: focused history/CLI/Sentry suite passes 143 tests; lint, zero-clone jscpd, 100% docstrings, package boundary, token/import/transport gates pass. A fresh temp workspace reproduced drift and now returns workspace_history_state_conflict with exit 4, preserves the external state, rolls back the attempted settings write, and points to pm history _workspace --verify. Live Sentry count remained six with no new event, then PM-CLI-2M was resolved."
  "2026-07-26T08:02:12.500Z","harness:codex","PR evidence: actionable workspace-history conflict classification ships in broad PR #734 at head 185693b9; exact hosted checks and bot reviews are pending."
